pendencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible on latest master, and 4.8 dev 7. \n- Not reproducible on 4.7.0\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - I doubt this is platform specific\n\n### Issue description\n\nCustom max size on my container is not working properly in my setup. Only the horizontal max size is set. The vertical size is much bigger than it needs to be.\n\n<img width=\"82\" height=\"223\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7561d8e1-be4a-4931-8b42-1196c39c4d44\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nWhile making the MRP, I noticed a few conditions that are required for this bug. \n\n1. Child nodes are added to the container after scene instantiation\n2. The initial size is wider than the child labels inserted\n3. One of the nodes is repositioned in `_ready`\n4. The labels inserted have autowrap mode `AUTOWRAP_WORD_SMART`\n\nFor example, without 2 by changing the tscn label text, the issue does not occur:\n\n<img width=\"90\" height=\"106\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/044c4089-46f9-4132-9398-cf453ddd00e2\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[custom-max-size-label-size.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33299830/custom-max-size-label-size.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124375/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124375/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}